      "text": "Book of Mormon is confirmed to others by ministering of angels, D&C 20:10. those baptized to be confirmed by laying on of hands for baptism of fire, D&C 20:41, 43, 68. those baptized to be confirmed by laying on of hands for gift of the Holy Ghost, D&C 20:43 (33:15). Church members to be instructed before being confirmed, D&C 20:68. continue in laying on of hands and confirming churches, D&C 24:9. Joseph Smith and Oliver Cowdery are confirmed Apostles by Peter, James, and John, D&C 27:12. the Lord confirmed priesthood upon Aaron1, D&C 84:18, 30. the Lord confirms upon elders priesthood which they have received, D&C 84:42. the Father confirmed covenant upon elders for sake of world, D&C 84:48. order of priesthood confirmed to be handed down from father to son, D&C 107:40. angels from Michael to present confirming our hope, D&C 128:21.",
